the euro area and so preserve the purchasing power of the single currency.","display_url":"link.europa.eu/XfnbnP","end":275,"expanded_url":"https://link.europa.eu/XfnbnP","images":[{"height":600,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111336462637465600/0koMfjM7?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111336462637465600/0koMfjM7?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":252,"status":200,"title":"IMFC Statement","unwound_url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/key/date/2026/html/ecb.sp261017~7015ea3099.en.html","url":"https://t.co/gH41KmaisG"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/dsVWnBuKg8","end":299,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ecb/status/2111336406672900429/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111323815053541376","start":276,"url":"https://t.co/dsVWnBuKg8"}]},"id":"2111336406672900429","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":15998,"like_count":147,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":34},"text":"The global economy has proven surprisingly resilient to uncertainty, says President @Lagarde. A return to an international economic order grounded in openness, predictability and the rule of law would help trade and investment. Read the IMFC statement https://t.co/gH41KmaisG https://t.co/dsVWnBuKg8","url":"https://x.com/ecb/status/2111336406672900429"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:39:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111331136966410278"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":168,"start":156,"tag":"IMFMeetings"}],"mentions":[{"end":46,"id":"292456706","start":39,"username":"MOFKSA"},{"end":67,"id":"1006746942","start":56,"username":"MAAljadaan"}],"urls":[{"description":"Bangkok, Thailand – October 17, 2026: The global economy has weathered the latest in a series of shocks better than expected, but continued resilience should not be taken for granted. Wars and conflicts continue to impose a heavy humanitarian toll, with large economic costs and significant negative spillovers, impacting the poorest and most vulnerable the hardest. Disruptions to supply chains are adding to uncertainty and price pressures. Major structural transformations are underway. In this more complex environment, which brings opportunities but also risks, our priority remains to promote macroeconomic and financial stability while enabling broad-based, private sector-led growth, and strengthening resilience through credible policies and international cooperation. Ending wars and conflicts and securing lasting peace around the world remains essential for sustainable growth and long-term stability.","display_url":"imf.org/en/news/articl…","end":193,"expanded_url":"https://imf.org/en/news/articles/2026/10/17/pr26340-chairs-statement-fifty-fourth-meeting-of-the-imfc","images":[{"height":405,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111331142913925120/bCootQD-?format=png&name=orig","width":400},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111331142913925120/bCootQD-?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":170,"status":200,"title":"Chair’s Statement Fifty-Fourth Meeting of the IMFC","unwound_url":"https://www.imf.org/en/news/articles/2026/10/17/pr26340-chairs-statement-fifty-fourth-meeting-of-the-imfc","url":"https://t.co/deb7vaEeYS"}]},"id":"2111331136966410278","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":27251,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":11},"text":"Read the statement from IMFC Chair and @MOFKSA Minister @MAAljadaan as the International Monetary and Financial Committee concludes its meeting at the 2026 #IMFMeetings.\nhttps://t.co/deb7vaEeYS","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2111331136966410278"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:25:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111327839094231532"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"IMFC Press Briefing","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":235,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1YxNrbpmLZLxw","images":[{"height":675,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111